\par
\tab\tab ASMIFN\tab A-B\tab\tab\tab /COMPARE A TO B.\par
\tab\tab D=3\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab /SET D TO 0003.\par
\par
\tab\tab The next line may be blank or consist of comments only \tab\tab\tab rendering the conditional moot.  During the early \tab\tab\tab\tab development of a program, this may deliberately be done to \tab\tab\tab force a specific outcome.\par
\par
\tab\tab Note: If additional statements are on the same line as the \tab\tab\tab ASMIFN directive [using \highlight1 ;\highlight0  to separate the statements] and \tab\tab\tab the conditional test fails, the additional statements are \tab\tab\tab also ignored.\page\cf3 Appendix B [continued].\par
