\tab\tab The specified \i expression\i0  is evaluated.  If the result is \tab\tab\tab non-zero, the \i statements\i0  contained within the \highlight1 <\highlight0  and \highlight1 >\highlight0  are \tab\tab\tab assembled.  If the result is zero, the \i statements\i0  contained \tab\tab within the \highlight1 <\highlight0  and \highlight1 >\highlight0  are ignored.\par
